   "resumo_en": "Down by the Jetty is the debut album by English rock band Dr. Feelgood, released in January 1975.\nThe band's Johnny Kidd & the Pirates-influenced originals (\"Keep It Out of Sight\") appear alongside covers material like \"Bonie Moronie\" and \"Tequila\".\nThe album was re-released as a double CD in 2006 (EMI 0946 363951 2 8).",
